---
// Full-text search with three placements of the write/read boundary. Bar lengths are illustrative, not measured.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 346" role="img" aria-label="Three ways to serve full-text search: no index does almost no work at write time and a lot at read time; an inverted index with a cache of common queries splits the work; precomputing every possible query is impossible.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Where the work happens in full-text search</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Công việc nằm ở đâu khi tìm kiếm toàn văn</tspan></text>
      <rect x="320" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="2" class="unb-panel is-good" />
      <text x="342" y="52" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Done when data arrives (write path)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Làm khi dữ liệu tới (đường ghi)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="640" y="40" width="14" height="14" rx="2" class="unb-panel is-fill" />
      <text x="662" y="52" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Done when asked (read path)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Làm khi có người hỏi (đường đọc)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="76" width="270" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="search" x={45} y={104} size={26} />
      <text x="179" y="100" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>No index</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không có index</tspan></text>
      <text x="179" y="117" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>scan all documents per query</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>quét mọi tài liệu mỗi lần hỏi</tspan></text>
      <rect x="320" y="78" width="14" height="28" rx="3" class="unb-panel is-good" />
      <rect x="334" y="78" width="526" height="28" rx="3" class="unb-panel is-fill" />
      <text x="320" y="124" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Writes are cheap, every read is slow.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ghi thì rẻ, nhưng mỗi lần đọc đều chậm.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="166" width="270" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="index" x={45} y={194} size={26} />
      <text x="179" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Index plus cache</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Index kèm cache</tspan></text>
      <text x="179" y="207" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>precompute the common queries</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tính sẵn các truy vấn phổ biến</tspan></text>
      <rect x="320" y="168" width="250" height="28" rx="3" class="unb-panel is-good" />
      <rect x="570" y="168" width="290" height="28" rx="3" class="unb-panel is-fill" />
      <text x="320" y="214" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-good"><tspan data-lang-en>The usual choice: some work up front, the rest at read time.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lựa chọn thường gặp: làm trước một phần, phần còn lại để lúc đọc.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="256" width="270" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box is-hot is-dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={45} y={284} size={26} />
      <text x="179" y="280" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Precompute everything</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tính sẵn mọi thứ</tspan></text>
      <text x="179" y="297" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>every possible word combination</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mọi tổ hợp từ có thể gõ</tspan></text>
      <rect x="320" y="258" width="520" height="28" rx="3" class="unb-panel is-hot" />
      <rect x="840" y="258" width="20" height="28" rx="3" class="unb-panel is-fill" />
      <text x="320" y="304" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>Impossible: the number of word combinations explodes.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bất khả thi: số tổ hợp từ bùng nổ theo cấp số nhân.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The boundary is a dial, not a switch: an index plus a cache of top queries sits between the two extremes. Bar lengths are illustrative.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ranh giới giống một núm vặn chứ không phải công tắc: index cộng cache các truy vấn phổ biến nằm giữa hai thái cực. Độ dài thanh chỉ để minh hoạ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
